<title>USA: TENNIS-CHICAGO WOMEN'S RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CHICAGO WOMEN'S RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the $450,000</p>
<p>Ameritech Cup women's tennis tournament Wednesday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>8-Magdalena Maleeva (Bulgaria) beat Sandrine Testud (France)</p>
<p>6-3 6-2</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>5-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) beat Stephanie DeVille</p>
<p>(Belgium) 6-1 6-2</p>
<p>Meredith McGrath (U.S.) beat 4-Iva Majoli (Croatia) 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>2-Jana Novotna (Czech Republic) beat Amy Frazier (U.S.) 6-2</p>
<p>6-1</p>
<p>1-Monica Seles (U.S.) beat Elena Likhovtseva (Russia) 6-2 6-1</p>
<p>Irina Spirlea (Romania) beat 6-Mary Joe Fernandez (U.S.) 6-1</p>
<p>6-2</p>
</text>
